{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/ecb36ffa028e742e7310c5c04d8e7735.poster.avif?t=1753425633\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/ecb36ffa028e742e7310c5c04d8e7735.webm?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/ecb36ffa028e742e7310c5c04d8e7735.mp4?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a sootball creature born from the festering abyss, forged as a living tool by the <strong>Abyssal Maw</strong> at the map's center. This realm is its digestive playground\u2014monsters spawn from rotting flesh carpets, and your sole purpose is to hunt, haul, and feed, using meat to quell its endless hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Haul Cycle</strong>: Slay mutated horrors spawned near the Abyssal Maw, drag corpses yourself, or command split-off <strong>Mini SootBall</strong> to assist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/d30c15d829d159caa1918fd8e896931c.poster.avif?t=1753425633\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/d30c15d829d159caa1918fd8e896931c.webm?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/d30c15d829d159caa1918fd8e896931c.mp4?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bone Currency</strong>: The Maw vomits &quot;Corrupted Bone Shards&quot; after devouring flesh. Spend them at the edge-of-map <strong>Chest Monster: Rotfang</strong> to choose 1 of 3 random upgrades (e.g., teleport dodge, poison mist, temporary shields).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/e07f0d5a6a4379b826924ab66280e842.poster.avif?t=1753425633\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/e07f0d5a6a4379b826924ab66280e842.webm?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/e07f0d5a6a4379b826924ab66280e842.mp4?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Challenges</strong>: The Maw may trigger mutations\u2014darkness leaving only its glow, or lava fissures splitting the ground. Survive these trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/8c2512def915f27c9f392473c50eb470.poster.avif?t=1753425633\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/8c2512def915f27c9f392473c50eb470.webm?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/8c2512def915f27c9f392473c50eb470.mp4?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong>: Deploy more Mini SootBall to boost hauling speed, or keep them close to slaughter faster. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/469526cfca040f173993cab22404a5e2.poster.avif?t=1753425633\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/469526cfca040f173993cab22404a5e2.webm?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/469526cfca040f173993cab22404a5e2.mp4?t=1753425633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Endgame</strong>:</i><br>Trade Bone Shards for power, build your sootball army, and survive the Maw\u2019s growing madness. But remember\u2014the more you feed it, the hungrier the abyss grows\u2026 and more terrifying creatures awaken.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732120?t=1753425633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732120?t=1753425633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/9306451682d8a5b41ee7369a0929b65738ee1a99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753425633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/9306451682d8a5b41ee7369a0929b65738ee1a99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753425633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/ecb36ffa028e742e7310c5c04d8e7735.p